      "author": "datadrivenangel",
      "published": "2026-09-18T21:00:32Z",
      "bullets": [
        "Anthropic's Claude Code CLI adopts an AGENTS.md fallback, aligning context injection behavior with multi-agent ecosystem conventions.",
        "AGENTS.md serves as an emerging tool-agnostic standard for defining build commands, architectural constraints, and repo guidelines across AI agents.",
        "Developers can reduce configuration sprawl by maintaining a unified agent instruction file rather than tool-specific artifacts like CLAUDE.md."
